    "text": "Part 2. Listening."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3",
    "startMs": 7300,
    "endMs": 7980,
    "text": "Kim Li Bufen."
  },
  {
    "id": "c4",
    "startMs": 8740,
    "endMs": 10220,
    "text": "1. Listen and choose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c5",
    "startMs": 10900,
    "endMs": 11120,
    "text": "Kim Li,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c6",
    "startMs": 11360,
    "endMs": 13780,
    "text": "Chen Chiu Tin Daadha Dan Suu Hui Tse"
  },
  {
    "id": "c7",
    "startMs": 13780,
    "endMs": 14620,
    "text": "Hui Tse Hui Tse Hui Tse Hui Tse Hui"
  },
  {
    "id": "c8",
    "startMs": 15330,
    "endMs": 20140,
    "text": "1. It always seems impossible until it's done."
  },
  {
    "id": "c9",
    "startMs": 22130,
    "endMs": 26360,
    "text": "2. We should reuse old boxes to make toys."
  },
  {
    "id": "c10",
    "startMs": 28400,
    "endMs": 32500,
    "text": "3. My father uses a laptop for his work."
  },
  {
    "id": "c11",
    "startMs": 34490,
    "endMs": 38560,
    "text": "4. You need to practice speaking English every day."
  },
  {
    "id": "c12",
    "startMs": 40810,
    "endMs": 43040,
    "text": "5. If you have a cough,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c13",
    "startMs": 43740,
    "endMs": 45100,
    "text": "drink more warm water."
  },
  {
    "id": "c14",
    "startMs": 46690,
    "endMs": 51360,
    "text": "6. Remember to look at the traffic lights before crossing the road."
  },
  {
    "id": "c15",
    "startMs": 52940,
    "endMs": 56660,
    "text": "7. The little cat is as small as a tennis ball."
  },
  {
    "id": "c16",
    "startMs": 58780,
    "endMs": 60260,
    "text": "2. Listen and judge."
  },
  {
    "id": "c17",
    "startMs": 69380,
    "endMs": 72120,
    "text": "1. Tom used to be shy."
  },
  {
    "id": "c18",
    "startMs": 72860,
    "endMs": 75160,
    "text": "He practiced telling stories every day."
  },
  {
    "id": "c19",
    "startMs": 75980,
    "endMs": 78420,
    "text": "Now he is a good storyteller in our class."
  },
  {
    "id": "c20",
    "startMs": 79640,
    "endMs": 86160,
    "text": "2. To protect the Earth we shouldn't use plastic bags every day."
  },
  {
    "id": "c21",
    "startMs": 86700,
    "endMs": 87580,
    "text": "We can use call-off"
  },
  {
    "id": "c22",
    "startMs": 87580,
    "endMs": 88340,
    "text": "bags instead."
  },
  {
    "id": "c23",
    "startMs": 90150,
    "endMs": 93360,
    "text": "3. Aniac was the first computer."
  },
  {
    "id": "c24",
    "startMs": 94260,
    "endMs": 95620,
    "text": "It was very big and heavy."
  },
  {
    "id": "c25",
    "startMs": 96440,
    "endMs": 98000,
    "text": "As heavy as four adult"
