    "text": "elephants."
  },
  {
    "id": "c27",
    "startMs": 100670,
    "endMs": 102240,
    "text": "4. When you have a fever,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c28",
    "startMs": 102880,
    "endMs": 105820,
    "text": "you should stay in bed and take the pill three times a day."
  },
  {
    "id": "c29",
    "startMs": 107940,
    "endMs": 111140,
    "text": "5. How can we save energy at home?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c30",
    "startMs": 112020,
    "endMs": 114200,
    "text": "We can turn off the TV after watching."
  },
  {
    "id": "c31",
    "startMs": 116540,
    "endMs": 117940,
    "text": "3. Listen and match."
