    "endMs": 152260,
    "text": "he joins the photo club to keep the sweet moments in life."
  },
  {
    "id": "c39",
    "startMs": 153880,
    "endMs": 157860,
    "text": "4. Shaapu was afraid to speak in front of my classmates,"
