    "endMs": 171700,
    "text": "and you can use your hair to make your hair."
  },
  {
    "id": "c45",
    "startMs": 174240,
    "endMs": 176520,
    "text": "It's important to live a greener life."
  },
  {
    "id": "c46",
    "startMs": 177800,
    "endMs": 181180,
    "text": "We can save water by turning off the tap when brushing teeth."
  },
  {
    "id": "c47",
    "startMs": 182720,
    "endMs": 186340,
    "text": "We can reuse old toys by giving them to other little kids."
  },
  {
    "id": "c48",
    "startMs": 187900,
    "endMs": 188800,
    "text": "When using computers,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c49",
